--- !u!114 &1701314861
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1701314859}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 74c47e3a0cf4baa409a657f200a9f294, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GJ.Game.ReadableNote
  text: 'DAY 7


    The armory. A hopper of sand holds

    the bolt. Empty it and
    the iron on

    the other side pulls it back.

    Sand runs slower than I breathe.


    At
    night something walks over the

    ceiling, up where the chapel is.

    Slow
    steps. Like it''s waiting.'
--- !u!23 &1701314862
